 one thing's for  certain intelligent life takes time to  evolve in our case at least 4 billion  years we've gradually changed from  simple single cells to the kind of  organism that can question its own  origins  and it's the moon that's provided the  stability for life to evolve by holding  the Earth's axial tilt steady for over 4  billion years
 

